keywords:
  - atomic structure
  - SUPERSTRUCTURE
  - Thomas-Fermi scaling parameters
  - Gaussian process
  - surrogate optimisation
  - NIST
  - NORAD
abstract: "Surrogate-model optimiser that tunes the lambda_nl scaling parameters of the atomic structure code SUPERSTRUCTURE against NIST energy levels with no per-ion input, makes level labels consistent with NIST where the energies decide it, checks A-values and level lifetimes against NIST, NORAD and measured values, and writes NORAD-format tables."
